				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Install Node.js with npm and make sure `npx` is available to GT. Follow the [Claude Code quickstart](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/quickstart), then run `claude` in a terminal to sign in.\n\nTo let the agent work with the running image, set up {{gtClass:GtLMcpServer}} following [[Working with GT as an MCP server]] and [[Adding tools to the GT MCP server]], then connect the agent to it."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
